OL,3,GNEWSARape charity rejects donations
OL,4,Afrom immigration campaign group
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Glasgow charity which supports the
OL,7,Fsurvivors of rape says it has turned
OL,8,Fdown a donation from a group which is
OL,9,Fcalling for tighter immigration laws.
OL,11,FA grouping known as Scottish Citizens
OL,12,FArmy said it had given women's hygiene
OL,13,Fkits to Glasgow & Clyde Rape Crisis
OL,14,F(GCRC).
OL,16,FBut in a statement, GCRC said it could
OL,17,Fnot accept further donations from the
OL,18,Fgroup because of concerns about
OL,19,F"messaging" associated with the
OL,20,Ffundraiser.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
